  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "__**BODMAS RULE**:__\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/337cba09b098a129c60c88ca431dc00f7470bb1b39c1452e8d81688a7d6b6b0e.png] \n\nLet's check each option:\n\n**Option 1. **÷, =, ×, +, –\n\nGiven equation: 50 * 5 * 10 * 1 * 5 * 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __**50 ÷ 5**__ = 10 × 1 + 5 - 5\n\n⇒ 10 = __**10 × 1**__ + 5 - 5\n\n⇒ 10 = __**10 +**____** 5**__ - 5\n\n⇒ 10 = __**15 - 5**__\n\n⇒ **10 = 10**\n\n**Option ****2** .÷, +, =, +, +\n\nGiven equation: 50 * 5 * 10 * 1 * 5 * 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __**50 ÷ 5**__ + 10 = 1 + 5 + 5\n\n⇒ **10 + 10 **= **1 + 5 + 5**\n\n⇒ 20 ≠ 11\n\n**Option ****3**. =, ×, +, +, –\n\nGiven equation: 50 * 5 * 10 * 1 * 5 * 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ 50 = __**5 × 10**__ + 1 + 5 - 5\n\n⇒ 50 = __**50 + 1 + 5**__ - 5\n\n⇒ 50 = 56 - 5\n\n⇒ 50 ≠ 51\n\n**Option ****4**. +, =, +, ×, ×\n\nGiven equation: 50 * 5 * 10 * 1 * 5 * 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ 50 + 5 = 10 + __**1 × 5 × 5**__\n\n⇒ __**50 + 5**__ = __**10 + 25**__\n\n⇒ 55 ≠ 35\n\nHence,\"** **÷, =, ×, +, –\" is the correct answer.",
